# Testing

- Add/adjust unit tests with any behaviour change in risk, validation, sentiment fallbacks, settings.
- Integration tests must cover dashboard pages render + `/api/health`.
- Mock network for news/LLM unit tests; optional live network only in explicit integration marks.
- Keep coverage meaningful; do not disable gates to hide failures.
- UI changes: run Playwright e2e or manual computer-use pass; capture screenshots under `docs/screenshots/`.
